      "text": "Measured 2026-11-05: gas ~0.125 gwei, ETH ~ $2,416\nGuessed gas units: setText 60k, 3-agent multicall 350k,\nrole grant 80k, small registry deploy 1.5M (NOT planned)\n-> records-only flow ~ $0.15 to $0.25 in gas\n-> no registration fee: mergit.eth is owned\n   (renewal date not checked)\n-> team holds 0.3 USDC on mainnet; USDC cannot pay gas",
      "originalText": "Measured 2026-11-05: gas ~0.125 gwei, ETH ~ $2,416\nGuessed gas units: setText 60k, 3-agent multicall 350k,\nrole grant 80k, small registry deploy 1.5M (NOT planned)\n-> records-only flow ~ $0.15 to $0.25 in gas\n-> no registration fee: mergit.eth is owned\n   (renewal date not checked)\n-> team holds 0.3 USDC on mainnet; USDC cannot pay gas",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
